   Resolve the new floors via the Databricks PyPI proxy, then rewrite
   URLs to files.pythonhosted.org / pypi.org/simple.
4. src/mcp-server/uv.lock
   Same regeneration for the standalone MCP graph.
5. docs/development.md
   Document the current security floors.

